        <object id="notes" label="&lt;b&gt;Key:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PII/PHI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; marks personal or health data; red dashed boxes are trust boundaries.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gaps (not drawn):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• No source classifies any data as personal (PII). Invoice images may show names and phone numbers of sole-trader suppliers, and master.supplier holds a phone number (AD-11): is any of it personal data under Singapore PDPA? Left unmarked until a source says so.&lt;br&gt;• Bank details are protected by AD-11 but are not PII/PHI tags; this diagram marks them in labels only.&lt;br&gt;• Document Intelligence and ACS Email are drawn inside the subscription because the spine puts them in rg shared (AD-17); it doesn&amp;#x27;t say whether Microsoft keeps submitted pages or emails beyond processing. Confirm the processing and retention terms.&lt;br&gt;• ACS stores email data in &amp;#x27;Asia Pacific&amp;#x27; (spine Open Questions): acceptable under P-15?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each element's source is in grey under its name and in its tooltip.">
          <mxCell style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fillColor=#FAFAFA;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
